{"severity":"error","file":"errors/cap_needs_9.march","start_line":11,"start_col":6,"end_line":11,"end_col":13,"message":"The `Inc` handler of actor `Counter` prints, but module `Main` declares no `needs IO.Console`, and `main` is granted nothing.\nhint: add this to the module body —\n        needs IO.Console\n`main` declares no grant of its own, so the module's `needs` line is its grant.","code":"cap_needs:IO.Console","fix":{"kind":"insert","after_line":6,"text":"  needs IO.Console","applicability":"machine-applicable"},"labels":[{"file":"errors/cap_needs_9.march","start_line":16,"start_col":9,"end_line":16,"end_col":11,"message":"`main` is granted nothing here"}],"notes":[],"category":"CAPABILITY"}
